# Deliberately untracked extensions — installed locally, never installed by `make ext`.
# Listed here only so `make ext-diff` stops reporting them as drift.
#
# Use this for extensions that have been pulled from both the Microsoft
# Marketplace and OpenVSX. They survive on machines that installed them before
# removal, but cannot be reproduced on a fresh Mac — so they must not go in the
# Extfile set, or `make bootstrap` would fail on a new machine.
#
# Uninstall these when you stop needing them; there is no way to get them back.

# --- Unpublished from both registries ---
# Run npm and package scripts from the file explorer (Cursor; gone from both registries)
jeremyrajan.file-script-runner
# Live Share extension pack, retired by Microsoft (Cursor; superseded by
# ms-vsliveshare.vsliveshare, which is VS Code only — see Extfile.vscode)
ms-vsliveshare.vsliveshare-pack
